    "scope": "A group data-policy import: Guardian's Horn, Manamune, Lord Dominik's Regards, Jak'Sho.",
    "policyNotes": [
      "Guardian's Horn Undaunted is modeled for non-DoT basic DPS as a flat -15 hp_change delta after percent modifiers; the DoT 3.75 branch is recorded but not simulated.",
      "Manamune Awe reads resolved mana as the DPS maximum mana policy and adds 2% of that value as flat attack damage; Manaflow charge growth is recorded but not simulated.",
      "Lord Dominik's Regards Giant Slayer reads an explicit target_bonus_health target attribute and clamps the outgoing damage increase to 0..15%.",
      "Jak'Sho Voidborn Resilience is modeled as a controlled full-stack policy: target bonus_armor and bonus_magic_resist attributes each add 30% of their value to final target armor and magic_resist."
    ],
